 safe integration point is presentation packaging after deterministic retrieval, not scoring: prior findings say the curator must not mutate scores or retrieval ordering and should attach `data.curatedContext` or affect presentation output only. [SOURCE: .opencode/specs/system-spec-kit/027-xce-research-based-refinement/research/iterations/iteration-026.md:22-35]\n5. Folding the curator into existing Phase 008 would blur concerns: Phase 008 already owns learning-feedback reducers and shadow-first retention/reducer paths, while the curator is a response-packaging feature with its own LLM cache, schema, timeout, telemetry, and eval questions. [SOURCE: .opencode/specs/system-spec-kit/027-xce-research-based-refinement/002-memory-store-and-search/004-learning-feedback-reducers/spec.md:61-86] [SOURCE: .opencode/specs/system-spec-kit/027-xce-research-based-refinement/research/iterations/iteration-026.md:82-108]\nCANDIDATES:\n - specs/system-deep-loop/036-deep-loop-innovation/001-research-inputs-and-architecture/001-deep-loop-market-research/research/iterations/iteration-026.md\n - specs/system-deep-loop/036-deep-loop-innovation/001-research-inputs-and-architecture/002-deep-loop-effectiveness-and-fanout/research/iterations-modes/iteration-026.md\n - specs/system-deep-loop/036-deep-loop-innovation/004-gate-closeout-and-drift/001-whole-system-gate/review/iterations/iteration-026.md\n - specs/system-deep-loop/z_archive/022-sk-deep-research-evolution/009-sk-deep-research-review-improvement-1/research/iterations/iteration-026.md\n - specs/system-deep-loop/z_archive/022-sk-deep-research-evolution/010-sk-deep-research-review-improvement-2/review/iterations/iteration-026.md\n - specs/system-deep-loop/z_archive/024-deep-loop-improved/001-reference-research/research/iterations/iteration-026.md\n - specs/system-deep-loop/z_archive/024-deep-loop-improved/research/lineages/glm/iterations/iteration-026.md\n - specs/system-deep-loop/z_archive/024-deep-loop-improved/research/lineages/gpt/it